        <briefdescription>
<para>Restore default signal handlers in a child process before execve. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>After fork the child inherits the parent&apos;s signal dispositions (SIG_IGN for interactive mode). We must reset them to SIG_DFL so the executed program responds to signals normally. </para>
        </detaileddescription>
